### =========================================================
### FOURTHDOWN AI - API TEST REQUESTS
### =========================================================


### ---------------------------------------------------------
### HEALTH
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Check backend health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health



### ---------------------------------------------------------
### TEAMS
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Get all teams
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams


### Get Alabama
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams/1


### Get Georgia
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams/2


### Create Alabama
### Only run this if Alabama does NOT already exist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alabama",
  "abbreviation": "ALA",
  "conference": "SEC",
  "city": "Tuscaloosa",
  "state": "Alabama",
  "logoUrl": "https://a.espncdn.com/i/teamlogos/ncaa/500/333.png"
}


### Create Georgia
### Only run this if Georgia does NOT already exist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Georgia",
  "abbreviation": "UGA",
  "conference": "SEC",
  "city": "Athens",
  "state": "Georgia",
  "logoUrl": "https://a.espncdn.com/i/teamlogos/ncaa/500/61.png"
}


### Create Texas
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams
Content-Type: application/json

