### ---------------------------------------------------------
### GAMES
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Get all games
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/games


### Get Game 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/games/1


### Create Alabama vs Georgia
### DO NOT run this again if Game 1 already exists
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeTeam": {
    "id": 1
  },
  "awayTeam": {
    "id": 2
  },
  "gameDate": "2026-09-19T19:30:00",
  "status": "SCHEDULED",
  "homeScore": null,
  "awayScore": null,
  "venue": "Bryant-Denny Stadium"
}


### Texas vs Georgia
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeTeam": {
    "id": 2
  },
