### ---------------------------------------------------------
### TEAM GAME STATS
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Get all team game stats
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stats


### Get stats for Game 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stats/game/1


### Get Alabama stats
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stats/team/1


### Get Georgia stats
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stats/team/2


### Create Alabama stats for Game 1
### Only run if these stats do NOT already exist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "game": {
    "id": 1
  },
  "team": {
    "id": 1
  },
  "points": 31,
  "totalYards": 421,
  "passingYards": 267,
  "rushingYards": 154,
  "turnovers": 1,
  "firstDowns": 23,
  "thirdDownAttempts": 12,
  "thirdDownConversions": 7,
  "redZoneAttempts": 4,
  "redZoneScores": 4,
  "penalties": 6,
  "penaltyYards": 52
}


### Create Georgia stats for Game 1
### Only run if these stats do NOT already exist
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "game": {
    "id": 1
  },
  "team": {
    "id": 2
  },
  "points": 24,
  "totalYards": 376,
  "passingYards": 242,
  "rushingYards": 134,
  "turnovers": 2,
  "firstDowns": 20,
  "thirdDownAttempts": 13,
  "thirdDownConversions": 5,
  "redZoneAttempts": 4,
  "redZoneScores": 3,
  "penalties": 8,
  "penaltyYards": 71
}



### ---------------------------------------------------------
### TEAM ANALYTICS
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Get Alabama analytics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analytics/teams/1


### Get Georgia analytics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analytics/teams/2

### Compare Alabama and Georgia
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analytics/compare?team1=1&team2=2

### Invalid comparison
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analytics/compare?team1=1&team2=1


### ---------------------------------------------------------
### DASHBOARD
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Get dashboard data
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/dashboard


### Test CFBD endpoint
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cfbd/games?year=2026&team=Alabama


### =========================================================
### REAL CFBD IMPORT
### =========================================================

### Import / synchronize real 2026 FBS games
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/import/season/2026

### Get real CFBD team game stats
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cfbd/team-stats?year=2026&week=1

### Get Alabama real game stats
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cfbd/team-stats/team?year=2026&team=Alabama

### Import FBS team metadata
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/import/teams/fbs/2026


### Import FCS team metadata
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/import/teams/fcs/2026


### Import FBS games
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/import/season/fbs/2026


### Import FCS games
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/import/season/fcs/2026

### Get all teams
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/teams


### Get to check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analytics/teams/1
### Import FBS season stats
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/import/stats/season/fbs/2026


### Import FCS season stats
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/import/stats/season/fcs/2026

### FourthDown AI matchup prediction
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/predictions/matchup?homeTeamId=1&awayTeamId=2

